{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37786","headline":"题汝州从事厅 · 郑谷","name":"题汝州从事厅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗人公署如山舍，秪向堦前便采薇。\n惊燕拂帘闲睡觉，落花沾砚会餐归。\n壁看旧记官多达，牓挂明文吏莫违。\n自说小池栽苇後，雨凉频见鹭鹚飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37786.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37786","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}